en remotely probable.<br /> <br /> * The office of vizereal counsel has no middle-eastern members named, 'Jafar'<br /> ** Nor are any of them plotting on taking over the local freehold.<br /> <br /> * Please stop asking the fairest to speak sindarin. None of them are elves.<br /> ** Or quenya<br /> *** In fact, stop asking them to speak any dialect or overarching language family associated with fae or elves. We fully realize that, 'Fae' is a sobriquet for the lost.<br /> ****This also extends to asking ogres to speak in the black speech of mordor.<br /> <br /> * Wizened do not sing as they work.<br /> <br /> * Stop using the clauses from contracts of fang and talon to reenact scenes from Disney movies. We understand that petting various skittish animals can be amazing stress relief, but attempting to do something so patently recognizable as singing with a bird is likely to attract gentry attention.<br /> <br /> * We don't care if you're a manikin kith or not. None of us asked for this.<br /> <br /> * Our more deranged levinquicks and manikins are not, 'SHODAN', 'HAL', 'I AM' or, 'GLaDOS'.<br /> <br /> * Please stop trying to pass your mien off as cosplay to wander in broad daylight without your mask. You're not fooling anyone.<br /> ** Even if you're at a convention of some variety.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2532,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2532-blitzkitty","user":"BlitzKitty","date":". 03-18-2014, 07:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2532-blitzkitty","name":"BlitzKitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-21T07:27:52-07:00","id":95603,"title":"","content":"laughed! that's clever!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Arref</b><br /> <s